msgid "**Break-glass access:** ``denyPasswordLogin`` only hides the form, so the local administrator’s password grant (``POST /api/oauth/token`` with ``client_id: administration`` and ``grant_type: password``) keeps working while SSO is on; the deploy itself uses it in ```files/php/oidc/client.php`` <./files/php/oidc/client.php>`__. The form comes back with ``bin/console system:config:set --json KskHeptacomAdminOpenAuth.config.denyPasswordLogin false``."
