msgid "**How much each factor counts is a number in `services.yml`, between 0 and 1.** `services.litellm.router.weights` carries one weight per factor: `locality`, `cost` and `speed`. Each factor is scaled to 0..1 *inside the candidate set* before its weight applies, because the raw units do not compare - a per-token price is a millionth of a cent and a rate is tens of tokens per second. A factor whose value is identical across the set scores every route 1 and therefore decides nothing, rather than ranking on a rounding artefact."
msgstr ""

