msgid "**Role Groups:** Every OIDC registration and login sets `admin` from the `administrator` role group and the `user_manager` role from the `user-manager` role group ([files/ruby/initializers/infinito_rbac.rb](./files/ruby/initializers/infinito_rbac.rb)). Only accounts with an OIDC identity change; the administrator the deploy seeds keeps its rights."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Role Groups:** On every new session [files/sso/header_auth.py](./files/sso/header_auth.py) sets the BookWyrm groups `admin`, `owner`, `moderator` and `editor` from the `administrator`, `owner`, `moderator` and `editor` role groups and grants staff with `admin`. The platform administrator that [tasks/01_site.yml](./tasks/01_site.yml) converges keeps its groups."
