msgid "Because the same variant can run several times in one sweep, the network mode is part of what identifies a job: it is in the job label (`🌐`, `🧅` or `🌈`) and in every artifact name. Two jobs uploading under one artifact name is a conflict, not an overwrite. The distro, filesystem and architecture glyphs follow it in the label (`🐳🧅🌀🦓🦾`), so a title says which combination died without opening the job."
msgstr ""

