msgid "Both name surfaces EspoCRM ships itself, so their payload stays with [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2), which renders `ESPOCRM_CONFIG_OIDC_*` and `ESPOCRM_CONFIG_SMTP_*` from the same service flags the addons' `enabled` expressions read; [`files/php/seed/config.php`](./files/php/seed/config.php) writes them into EspoCRM's own config."
