msgid "Infinito.Nexus up to v0.10.0 ran the Bitnami image with ``moodle_code`` at ``/bitnami/moodle`` and ``moodle_data`` at ``/bitnami/moodledata``. Both volumes keep their names, and the code and the data sit at the volume root in both layouts, so nothing moves. The entrypoint names a code volume whose ``config.php`` points below ``/bitnami`` in its log, adopts its release, replaces the tree and the ``config.php``, and hands the data volume to ``www-data`` (uid 33)."
msgstr ""

