msgid "The playbook enables and starts every `*.infinito.nexus` timer. The services run on their timer schedule and are not started directly."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The playbook is designed for developers who require Docker in their local development environments. It simplifies the process of Docker installation and configuration, making it straightforward for developers to start containerizing their applications without the complexities often encountered in a server or production environment."
msgstr "Spelboken är utformad för utvecklare som kräver Docker i sina lokala utvecklingsmiljöer. Det förenklar processen för Docker-installation och konfiguration, vilket gör det enkelt för utvecklare att börja behålla sina applikationer utan komplexiteten som ofta uppstått i en server eller produktionsmiljö."

msgid "The playbook runs `compose down` in every directory directly below `/opt/compose/` that contains a `compose.yml`. A directory that contains a `docker-compose.yml` instead gets `docker compose down --remove-orphans`. Containers and project networks are removed. Volumes and shared networks declared as `external: true` stay in place."
msgstr ""

msgid "The playbook runs `compose up -d` in the same directories, in any order. Start the timers afterwards with the [Services](../services/README.md) playbooks."
msgstr ""

msgid "The playbook stops and disables every `*.infinito.nexus` timer, then stops every `*.infinito.nexus` service. Disabled timers stay off after a reboot. A service that is running at that moment, such as a backup, is aborted."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The plugin answers ``initialize`` without credentials, because that call is capability negotiation and carries no data. Everything after it is guarded: an unauthenticated ``tools/list`` is refused and returns no tool inventory."
msgstr "Plugin svarar ``initialize`` utan referenser, eftersom det samtalet är förhandlingsförmåga och inte bär några data. Allt efter det är bevakat: en oautentiserad ``tools/list`` vägras och returnerar ingen verktygsinventering."

