# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs a systemd unit that snapshots each configured source directory into `<backups>/<machine-hash>/backup-secrets-to-local/<generation>/files/<name>`, hard-linked against the previous generation. Optional sources are skipped when absent (the CA in Let's Encrypt mode, ACME/certbot in self-signed mode). The generation joins the same backup tree the pull and device roles consume, so it flows to the backup host and the encrypted device automatically."
msgstr "Rollen installerar en systemad enhet som snapshots varje konfigurerad källkatalog till `<backups>/<machine-hash>/backup-secrets-to-local/<generation>/files/<name>`, hårdkopplad mot den tidigare generationen. Valfria källor hoppas när de saknas (CA i Let's Encrypt mode, ACME/certbot i självsignerat läge). Generationen går samma backup träd pull och enhet roller konsumerar, så det flyter till backup värd och den krypterade enheten automatiskt."

