# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role runs Memcached as a central engine dependency, mirroring the central-database pattern (``svc-db-postgres``). A consumer reaches it either embedded (a sidecar inside its own stack, ``shared: false``) or from this central pinned stack (``shared: true``)."
msgstr "Denna Ansible roll körs Memcached som ett centralt motorberoende, vilket speglar centraldatabasmönstret (``svc-db-postgres``). En konsument når den antingen inbäddad (en sidovagn inuti sin egen stack, ``shared: false``) eller från denna centrala pinned stack (``shared: true``)."

