# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Two controls stack. The actuating tools are named in ``tools.mutating``, and ``mutating_tools_enabled: false`` withholds them from every client’s include list, so an agent is offered ``GetDateTime``, ``GetLiveContext`` and ``todo_get_items`` only. Entity exposure bounds those: only entities exposed to Assist are reachable, and the role exposes none. Setting ``mutating_tools_enabled: true`` offers the actuating tools as well; entity exposure then decides what they can reach."
msgstr "Två kontroller stack. Aktuerande verktyg namnges i ``tools.mutating``, och ``mutating_tools_enabled: false`` undanhåller dem från varje kunds lista, så en agent erbjuds ``GetDateTime``, ``GetLiveContext`` och ``todo_get_items`` endast. Entitetsexponering begränsar dessa: endast enheter som utsätts för assistans är tillgängliga, och rollen avslöjar ingen. Inställning ``mutating_tools_enabled: true`` erbjuder också aktiveringsverktygen; entitetsexponering bestämmer sedan vad de kan nå."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Two controls stack. The actuating tools are named in `tools.mutating`, and `mutating_tools_enabled: false` withholds them from every client's include list, so an agent is offered `GetDateTime`, `GetLiveContext` and `todo_get_items` only. Entity exposure bounds those: only entities exposed to Assist are reachable, and the role exposes none. Setting `mutating_tools_enabled: true` offers the actuating tools as well; entity exposure then decides what they can reach."
