msgid "Walk a (possibly nested) credentials schema and emit one vault block per scalar leaf into ``dest_node``. Nested dicts (e.g. ``secrets.credentials.recaptcha = {key, secret}``) recurse into nested CommentedMaps so each leaf becomes its own vault-encrypted entry instead of being collapsed via ``str(dict)`` into a Python-repr blob (the regression that broke run 26428080957 jobs 77797371397 and 77797371442 for web-app-espocrm and web-app-listmonk)."
msgstr "Promenera en (möjligen Nested) credentials schema och avge ett valvblock per skalärblad in ``dest_node``. Nested dikter (t.ex. ``secrets.credentials.recaptcha = {key, secret}``) återkommer till Nested CommentedMaps så att varje blad blir en egen valv-krypterad post istället för att kollapsas via ``str(dict)`` till en Python-repr blob (Regressionen som bröt springa 26428080957 jobb 77797371397 och 77797371442 För web-app-espocrm och web-app-listmonk)."

