msgid "`auth_subject: user` or `auth: oidc` requires a `delegation` block; see [delegation.md](mcp/delegation.md)."
msgstr "`auth_subject: user` eller `auth: oidc` kräver att en `delegation` block; se [delegation.md](mcp/delegation.md)."

