msgid "`tasks/03_administrator.yml` posted the group member object on every deploy with a body XWiki ignored (`<properties>` wrapper, text outside `<value>`), so an existing installation carries one empty `XWiki.XWikiGroups` object on `XWiki.XWikiAdminGroup` per earlier deploy (measured: two). The post now carries the member and runs once. Options: delete the empty member objects through REST, or leave them (they grant nothing)."
